desktop-shell-print-sway-theme(1)

# NAME

desktop-shell-print-sway-theme - print the sway bar's colors and font as a theme

# SYNOPSIS

*desktop-shell-print-sway-theme*

# DESCRIPTION

Prints the colors and font of the running sway bar as a style sheet for the
desktop shell components. The bar and the switcher read them from sway by
themselves; the login screen starts before sway and cannot, so save the theme
where it looks:

```
desktop-shell-print-sway-theme | sudo tee /etc/xdg/desktop-shell-components/shared-theme.css
```

Exits with a non-zero status when sway has no bar or cannot be reached.

# SEE ALSO

*desktop-shell-login-greeter*(1), *sway-bar*(5)
